          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "FarMart Turns EBITDA Profitable in Q4 FY26, Hits Rs 3,600 Crore Run Rate With AI-Powered Agri Workflows",
            "articleSection": "Job Evolution",
            "abstract": "Agrifood platform FarMart has reached EBITDA profitability in Q4 FY26 and achieved a Rs 3,600 crore annualised revenue run rate, attributing its 50 percent year-on-year growth to deeper farmer wallet share, stronger supply chain networks, and AI-powered workflows across its operations. The decade-old platform connects farmers, input suppliers, and agri-businesses, with AI now embedded in procurement, logistics, and advisory services. The milestone is significant for India's agritech sector, which has seen multiple high-profile shutdowns in recent years.",
            "url": "https://yourstory.com/2026/05/farmart-turns-ebitda-profitable-in-q4-fy26-hits-rs-3600-crore-run-rate",
